{"3598550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Atlas Hands", "steam_appid": 3598550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deep in an abandonned bidirectional research facility, Red sends a distress call. Everybody has died. Device spheres are still active and the sentinels also. You have to find a MindGun. Save Red.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rotate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You interact with core elements by <strong>rotating them</strong>. The MindGun has been designed to handle the specific needs of the complex. Manage threats and devices by mastering this tool. <strong>Shoot, rotate, repulse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/9aeb8e4b5837d497464b3f598d0260c8.poster.avif?t=1774437877\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/9aeb8e4b5837d497464b3f598d0260c8.webm?t=1774437877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/9aeb8e4b5837d497464b3f598d0260c8.mp4?t=1774437877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red thought he was alone: it is not the case anymore. <strong>Sneak is often the best first move</strong> before encountering situations that will be increasingly more difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The whole area has been abandonned since obscure events: be aware of your surroundings.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/ex